\title{A Real-Time Multi-Index Astrophysical Refraction Engine with 
Closed-Loop Deterministic Invariant Verification (CL-DIV)}

\author[0000-0000-0000-0000]{C.~Matthew~Blackwell}

\begin{abstract}
We present a real-time astrophysical refraction engine integrating 
GPU-accelerated eikonal solvers, sparse voxel octrees, multi-wavelength 
dispersion sampling, and a Closed-Loop Deterministic Invariant Verifier (CL-DIV). 
CL-DIV enforces bitwise determinism, numerical stability, and cryptographically 
auditable correctness. This architecture establishes a new class of scientific 
instrument for real-time astrophysical lensing analysis.
\end{abstract}

